	"bugClass": {
		"id": "unbound-session-message-delivery",
		"title": "Messages reported without run-bound delivery or replies",
		"cause": "A message is treated as delivered when it is merely persisted as a note, with no dispatch to the live session pane; replies are inferred from recent notes without correlating them to the originating run. A related failure occurs when text is typed into a pane without first binding that pane to the exact target run.",
		"criteria": "Classify a site when either (1) it reports delivery or receipt based on storing or reading a note/message without dispatching to the intended live session, or (2) it types into a pane without pinning the exact target run. Also classify when replies are selected from recent notes without a run- or request-keyed correlation channel. These mechanisms may occur independently.",
